WEBVTT

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.910
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:22.620
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.410
Huh?

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.800
What do you think <i>you're</i> doing?

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.390
I could ask you the same.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.970
You're still hanging around this town?

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.350
Those damn toys of yours were a real pain in the ass for me to deal with, you know?

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:45.100
Don't blame me for doing my job.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.110
As an exorcist, I can't leave this town until I've driven you out.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.740
Driven me out? Didn't your Mama teach you to treat a lady right?

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:59.660
Well, you see, I can't think of anybody as a woman unless they have tits.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.120
Hey! We got a big, fat one over here!

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.580
Grab a spear! Grab anything that even <i>looks</i> like a spear!

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:08.460
Got one!

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.460
Are fish from this river even edible?

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:17.470
I'm not after fish! This is a Gadget of Misfortune that brings in help from the World of Gods!

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:21.810
Now come, Unfortunate One!

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.980
Y-You!

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:29.230
Momou?

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:33.990
Miss Momiji!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:15.460
Is it really you?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.170
It's been so long, Miss Momiji!

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.300
I waited and waited but you didn't come back,

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:24.720
and I thought you might've lost your way in the humans' seedy underworld and gotten sucked into the stripper business!

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:26.720
I was so, so worried!

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:29.850
You think I'm like one of those musicians that move to Tokyo but never make it big?

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.390
But, Momou...

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.190
It's really been a while, hasn't it?

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:34.980
Shake!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.690
Switch!

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:37.690
Bondage!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:42.780
That's it! Good boy! Here's your reward!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:45.700
You were asking for this, weren't you? Weren't you?

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.290
I was! It's been so long!

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.250
Who the hell's this kid?

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.710
He's a Dog God.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.790
His name is Inugami Momou.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.800
Now that I look more closely... You're human?!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:06.680
You got some nerve to be talkin' to Miss Momiji like that, pal!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:07.930
This guy's kink is...

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:08.890
masochism!

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.600
I can tell that just by looking at him.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:18.900
I just thought of a great way to steal Sakura Ichiko's Fortune.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:22.240
Provided you're able to assist me, Momou.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.400
Anything you say!

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:27.240
For you, I'd jump into a fire, plunge into an icy lake, or dig through a mountain of needles!

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.620
That's just what <i>you</i> want!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:30.870
Well then, let's start

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.870
with this kettle of boiling water.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:38.630
Ooh, it's steaming! What're you gonna do to me?

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:39.710
Drink!

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.930
What the hell are you guys doing?

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.640
Don't try this at home!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:54.600
Yes, yes, yes! Here it comes!

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.520
Wh-What is this?

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:04.820
When Momou experiences enough pleasure, he transforms into his true Dog God form!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.160
His true form?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:18.830
Dog Gods are revered for their ability to fulfill the wishes of their master while protecting their Fortune,

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:22.340
and because of that loyalty, are also feared as evil gods

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:26.630
that bring calamity without mercy to any that dare harm their master.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:33.890
So this, then, is the true form of the fearsome...

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:34.890
Dog God?

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.570
Uh...

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.570
He shrank!

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.950
Are you ready, Momou?

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:55.200
Listen carefully. This is something only you can do.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.010
<i>I'm feeling pretty good today!</i>

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:11.890
<i>Haven't heard a peep from that walking guilt trip in ages. With any luck, she just gave up and went home.</i>

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.980
<i>So we meet at last, Sakura Ichiko.</i>

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:29.360
Do you understand, Momou? I'm counting on you.

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:35.040
Pretend to be a cute dog, get close to Sakura Ichiko, and drain every last drop of her Fortune! Got it?

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:38.370
Huh?

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:44.960
Oh, but like, that'd be such a paaain...

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:51.090
And Momou, should you succeed,
I'll reward you better than ever before.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:55.770
Better than ever before?

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:59.600
That's not bondage, that's just execution!

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:05.110
<i>Leave it to me, Miss Momiji! It's the duty of every
Dog God to make their master's wishes come true!</i>

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.570
<i>Take this, human!</i>

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:06.980
<i>Secret Technique!</i>

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.340
<i>What?! Why didn't my Temptation work?!</i>

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:28.300
<i>I could've sworn that dog was doing that on purpose!</i>

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.590
Excuse me, Miss Sakura.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:31.930
Oh, Mr. Manager.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:38.720
We don't disallow pets, but could you at least put a collar and leash on him?

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:39.980
Pets?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.400
N-No! This isn't my dog!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.650
Really? He seems to know you quite well.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:51.700
Wh-What's going on?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.450
You'll be in big trouble if he bites a child or something.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.620
As his owner, you're responsible for everything he does.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:04.420
Why do I have to take this thing in?

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.670
Guess I don't have much choice right now. I'll try and give him to someone at school.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:13.680
I'm only taking you in 'til then because I have to, got it?

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:15.050
<i>Sucker.</i>

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.060
<i>Once I'm in, you're mine!</i>

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.310
<i>Once I get my grubby paws on your Fortune, I'm outta here!</i>

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.610
<i>What the shit?!</i>

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.820
Ugh, it's such a mess.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.570
I just had this place cleaned three days ago, too!

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:38.280
<i>How the hell could this happen in three days? It friggin' stinks!</i>

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.200
Guess I'll just have to call the cleaners again.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:45.040
<i>I get it. So that butler Suwano did all the housework up 'til now.</i>

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.790
<i>But would it kill her to clean up after herself?!</i>

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.300
<i>No matter. It's gonna take more than this to beat me!</i>

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.760
Here's a Gadget of Misfortune I got from Momiji:

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.880
Gabriel 2012!

00:08:54.880 --> 00:09:00.310
Not only does it drain the victim's Fortune,
its iron teeth are guaranteed to hurt like hell!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.270
<i>Lock 'n' load!</i>

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:07.230
But man, what am I supposed to do about these dirty dishes?

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:12.990
Well, whatever. Let's see...

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.030
<i>Target locked on.</i>

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:18.910
<i>Lemme help myself to some of that Fortune!</i>

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:19.950
Whoops.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.580
<i>Oh, shi—</i>

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.080
<i>Damn, I was so close...</i>

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.000
<i>Oh Jesus, my eyes!</i>

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.250
<i>Dammit, how much Fortune does this girl ha—</i>

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:35.880
Geez, what are you doing down there?

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.760
Taking a nap? You must be exhausted.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.430
<i>You've got it... all... wrong...</i>

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:46.520
Huh? Momo...u? What a strange name.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.950
<i>You're wide open, human.</i>

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:02.200
<i>No amount of Fortune's gonna protect you in your sleep!</i>

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.450
<i>It's over!</i>

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:13.590
<i>Was that thanks to her Fortune as well? Or was she just turning in her sleep?</i>

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:13.880
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:18.050
<i>Hurts so good...</i>

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:18.930
<i>No!</i>

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.300
<i>If I experience any more pleasure, I'll revert to my human form!</i>

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:25.060
<i>Damn you, human! I won't lose to you!</i>

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.770
Wait for me, Miss Momiji!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.020
And you know what that skank said after that?!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:39.660
She pushed up her own tits and said, "Aren't you more like the God of Flatness than the God of Misfortune?"

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.530
What the hell? Isn't she the fuckin' worst?!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.370
It's all about milk! You gotta drink more milk!

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.620
I have! I've been drinking milk for a hundred fuckin' years!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:51.920
Goddamnit, Tittyko! Next time, even cryin' for your mommy ain't gonna save you!

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.690
Here are your tests from before.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.610
Not bad, I guess.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.150
Amazing as always, Sakura!

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.610
You're in a totally different league to the rest of us!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:24.620
Oh, don't be so hard on yourselves. I have to study a lot, too!

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:25.830
You're always so humble!

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:32.080
Hmm. Hated by the girls, loved by the boys.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.710
Just as Miss Momiji's intel said.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:39.090
At the moment, the protection conferred by her Fortune is absolute.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:43.050
Therefore we should take this time to reorganize and study the enemy!

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:45.180
We're lacking a crucial member of the team, anyway.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:48.350
Oh God, my head... Water... I need water...

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:54.610
<i>I'll record what I've observed about Sakura Ichiko thus far.</i>

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.650
<i>With her excellent grades and athleticism,</i>

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.740
<i>it's clear her wit and beauty aren't just for show.</i>

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:05.620
<i>She's hit on by guys wherever she goes, and rejects them without exception.</i>

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:09.120
<i>As stated in the intel, she has a quick temper and distasteful personality.</i>

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:10.870
<i>She's here.</i>

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:17.670
How's it going?

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.510
<i>Looks like she's in a good mood.</i>

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.930
<i>This wasn't in Momiji's intel.</i>

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:33.890
<i>She'd never smile like that for anyone at school.</i>

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.900
<i>What is it? What's she reading?</i>

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:49.620
What's this?

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:53.710
Oh, they're just letters from her butler.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:57.210
<i>I was hoping it'd be something I could exploit.</i>

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:02.800
I found some old pictures of you while I was organizing my photo album.

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.470
To think you'd end up so well endo—

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:10.010
I mean, I couldn't have imagined how beautifully you'd grow up back then.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:12.180
Such casual sexual harassment.

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:16.060
My new wife suggested that I learn Tai-chi.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:21.440
I'm going to train hard so that one day I'll be ready to battle your would-be groom...

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.400
Or at least, that's the plan.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:26.660
<i>He's pretty active for an old man that nearly died.</i>

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.740
<i>So he was like a father to her, huh?</i>

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:35.040
This Suwano guy is the only person she cares for.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:38.290
She may be closer to him than she ever was to her real parents.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:46.800
<i>If only you were capable of treating others with even a fraction of the kindness you show Suwano.</i>

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:51.140
Here's another Gadget of Misfortune I got from Momiji:

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:54.640
Straw Voodoo Doll: Type Mini!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:14:00.560
Just pull out the nail, and everyone within a one meter radius will be cursed with Misfortune!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.650
There's no way you can run from this one.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:05.570
Huh?

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.070
...wano. Suwano.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.410
Wh-What's up with this girl?

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:14.240
Dammit!

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.920
Crap, is she really awake?

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:18.500
Huh?

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.000
Oh shit! I pulled it out!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:24.460
Dammit! If I don't get away from here soon, I'll fall victim to the curse as well!

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:25.010
Ohh...

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.260
Don't "Ohh..." me!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:27.800
I can't breathe!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:36.060
And why isn't anything happening?

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:40.940
Does her Fortune even protect her against this?!

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.570
Oh shit, I overslept!

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:50.160
Wait, Momou, why are you sleeping there?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.820
Whatever, gotta go!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.830
Excuse us! Housecleaning!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.580
Can we just go in?

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:04.880
It's fine, it's fine. She always has us come when she's out.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:05.840
I see...

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:08.050
Whoa, it's filthy! And it stinks!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.680
We'll clean this room first.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:13.600
You can basically just throw away everything except clothes and dishes.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:17.770
Just make sure you don't touch anything on top of her desk.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:18.600
Okay.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.730
Uh, there was a dog sleeping on her bed.
What should we do with it?

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.860
I don't think we can throw <i>that</i> away.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:33.280
No, no, it's not here! Why? Why isn't it here?

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:36.660
I <i>told</i> you not touch anything on my desk!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.910
She only just got home, and she's already kicking up a fuss...

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:43.040
You didn't touch it?! Then why isn't it there?!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.420
That's right! A flower-patterned box!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.760
Box? The one with the letters from her butler?

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:51.050
What? You might've thrown it away?!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.300
Then where'd you take it?!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:01.940
Important or not, all I know is that if it was in today's trash, it'll be somewhere in here.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.980
That's fine. Let me look for it.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.060
W-Wait!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.650
<i>It'll be fine. I'll find it for sure!</i>

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:11.070
<i>I-I have Fortune on my side, after all!</i>

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:15.120
<i>There's no way... There's no way I could lose it.</i>

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:23.750
<i>So this is her Misfortune. Looks like that doll's curse worked after all.</i>

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:27.420
<i>I was hoping for something a little more painful, but this'll do.</i>

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:29.960
<i>Now's my chance.</i>

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:38.470
<i>Might as well wait a bit. It'll probably be easier to take her Fortune when she's tired out.</i>

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.440
<i>She's still at it?</i>

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:52.950
<i>Surely at this point you should just give up on it being here, Fortune or no Fortune?</i>

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:06.040
<i>Oh, morning already. I guess she went home.</i>

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:06.580
<i>Huh?</i>

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:13.260
Miss! Are you still looking?!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.010
Were you here all night?!

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.180
I'm fine.

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.300
Leave me alone.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.520
<i>What is this? Aren't they just letters?</i>

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:25.770
<i>And besides... You're not that kind of person!</i>

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:32.280
Sakura Ichiko is a brute of a woman who wouldn't bat an eye at plunging others into despair for the sake of her own happiness.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.780
Her outer appearance belies her depraved personality.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:40.950
She's haughty and domineering, has no common sense, and can't read between the lines. She's unbelievable!

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:47.670
I'll... I'll find it for sure! There's no way I could lose it!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.210
I mean...

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.210
They're from Suwano!

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:55.470
It's full of the letters Suwano sent me!

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.600
<i>Damn it... Goddamn it!</i>

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:06.140
Wh-What?

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:10.730
M-Momou?

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.610
When did you get here?

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:15.070
This is no place for a dog like—

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:16.740
Huh?

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.860
No way! Is that it?!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:21.370
<i>Don't underestimate a Dog God's nose.</i>

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.870
It is! It is!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.670
It's here!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.630
<i>A haughty, domineering, unbelievable woman...</i>

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:40.470
<i>All I see is a kid in tears.</i>

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:41.850
Momou!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.930
Thank you, Momou!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:50.150
Thank you so much!

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:51.440
<i>So which is it?</i>

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.230
<i>Which one is the real you?</i>

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.690
Oh man, I reek.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.110
Time for a bath.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:06.660
That was my big chance, and I blew it.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:07.750
I'm sorry,

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:09.830
Miss Momiji.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.960
Did you... Did you feel sorry for her?

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:18.720
It's not like that. And I didn't want her to be indebted to me either.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.970
It's just that...

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:26.930
To me, she didn't seem to be as bad of a person as you said.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.350
That's all it was.

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:29.980
I see.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:37.690
Momou!

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:42.360
<i>But don't think this makes us friends.</i>

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:48.040
<i>No matter what kind of person you are, I'm still going to take your Fortune.</i>

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:55.750
<i>Wh-What the fuck is going on?!</i>

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:58.800
I'm so glad you were there, Momou!

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:02.300
I wonder if it was my Fortune that brought you to me as well?

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.260
<i>Spare me the blind optimism—</i>

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.890
Oh? Does that feel good?

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:11.270
<i>Oh no, don't do that!</i>

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.940
M-Momou?

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:19.030
Fuck my life!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:22.900
Momou returns to normal if he feels any sort of pleasure, not just masochism!

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:26.700
And who might you be? I do hope you're not a friend of that God of Misfortune...

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.910
W-Wait, calm down! Calm down! Hear me out!

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:37.250
If I calm down... are you saying the fact that you saw me naked will just go away?!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:41.050
I-Is that bath supposed to come out like that?!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.970
You pretended to be a dog this whole time to get my Fortune, didn't you?!

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:46.640
I wasn't pretending! I really am a dog!

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.510
Don't make me laugh!

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:52.980
<i>Momiji was right after all!</i>

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:55.350
<i>This girl is a brute... A brute!</i>

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:57.770
<i>That's right, she's a brute... but...</i>

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:02.110
More! Harder! Give it to me!

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.780
You're just a pervert!

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:04.910
Inexcusable!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.030
Where's the pervert?!

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:08.780
<i>You're</i> a fucking pervert!

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:09.530
Correct!

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:13.160
Everyone looks like they're having <i>so</i> much fun!

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:16.080
I want in too!

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:19.210
Oh no, Momou's done for! But he's smiling!

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.920
You diseased whore!

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:25.380
Don't do it, stop! Momou's out!

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:29.010
I'll reduce you gods to ash!

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:32.890
But I'm human!

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:07.650
Please... Let me call you Miss Ichiko!

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:09.150
Shut up! Go away!

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:10.910
Huh?

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:12.160
Momou...

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:15.660
What the hell do you think you're doing?!

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:20.500
This is... such a great feeling!

00:23:22.530 --> 00:23:24.880
This week's <i>Nadeshiko ga</i>!

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:26.880
This week, I only showed up once!

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:32.050
If you thought I'd start showing up more after last week, too bad for you!
